cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "State of ATS 2026: employer-to-applicant-tracking-system attribution"
version: 2.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-09
abstract: >-
  A selected sample of 738 employers with recorded ATS attributions. On
  2026-10-09, 421 rows were re-verified with live evidence (420 confirmed and
  1 vendor change), down from 704 previously marked verified, because only
  rows with live hard evidence stayed in the headline base. 317 rows are
  labeled not re-verified in Oct 2026; their earlier vendor, host, method, and
  date are kept and are not treated as wrong. Shares describe the re-verified
  subset only. That subset skews toward vendors with public job APIs and is
  not an estimate of market share. Observed hosts do not establish private
  screening configurations.
type: dataset
license: MIT
